</b></p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [493.868, 554.515, 955.976, 597.1700000000001]}, {"polygon": [[269.96000000000004, 601.6600000000001], [1178.296, 601.6600000000001], [1178.296, 801.4649999999999], [269.96000000000004, 801.4649999999999]], "confidence": 0.9614047804185726, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 6, "html": "<p>In memory of his illustrious mother Smt Moortidevi<br/>and<br/>promoted by his benevolent wife<br/><b>Smt. Rama Jain</b></p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [269.96000000000004, 601.6600000000001, 1178.296, 801.4649999999999]}, {"polygon": [[219.144, 909.225], [1229.112, 909.225], [1229.112, 1333.53], [219.144, 1333.53]], "confidence": 0.9614047804185726, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 7, "html": "<p>In this Granthamala critically edited jain agamic, philosophical, puranic, literary, historical and other original texts in Prakrit, Sanskrit, Apabhramsha, Hindi, Kannada, Tamil etc are being published in original form with their translations in modern languages<br/>Also being published are catalogues of Jain bhandaras, inscriptions, studies on art and architecture by competent scholars and also popular Jain literature</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [219.144, 909.225, 1229.112, 1333.53]}, {"polygon": [[708.248, 1434.555], [733.6560000000001, 1434.555], [733.6560000000001, 1463.74], [708.248, 1463.74]], "confidence": 0.9614047804185726, "label": "Picture", "raw_label": "Image", "reading_order": 8, "html": "", "skipped": true, "error": false, "bbox": [708.248, 1434.555, 733.6560000000001, 1463.74]}, {"polygon": [[425.584, 1528.845], [1013.144, 1528.845], [1013.144, 1620.8899999999999], [425.584, 1620.8899999999999]], "confidence": 0.9614047804185726, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 9, "html": "<p><b><i>General Ediotrs (First Edition)</i></b><br/>Dr Hiralal Jain &amp; Dr A N Upadhye</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [425.584, 1